        "content": "Read-only. Source -> commit latency, real values from `ingest_ts` (migration 081), no simulated data. Does **not** show time-until-next-dashboard-refresh -- that's a per-dashboard config choice (5s-5m), not a pipeline latency. See `tests/e2e/ingestion-latency-check.js` for the same measurement as a scriptable evidence artifact."
      },
