      "description": "P95 source_ts -> ingest_ts latency, condition-driven alarms only (logdate = real telemetry-query-resolve time, not backdated). This is the real alarm ingest latency. Alarms are rare/debounced by design -- low sample count in a quiet window is expected, not a bug."
